msgstr "**关系**"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:28
msgid "the formula field and its verdict line; _Add definition_ / _Save definition_ / _Revert_ / _Detach definition_; findings under the field; for a Source, _Realization: Provided by the environment; no device is bound yet._ above the field; _Depends on_ (what the formula names) and _Named in_ (whose formulas name this) as name links"
msgstr "公式字段及其判定行；_添加定义_ / _保存定义_ / _还原_ / _分离定义_；字段下方的发现；对于来源，字段上方有 _实现：由环境提供；尚未绑定设备。_；_依赖于_（公式提到的关系）和 _被提及于_（其公式提到本关系的关系），以名字链接呈现"

#: docs/user-guide/studio/inspector.md:28
