msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/studio/system-projects.md:89
msgid "**Instance** — _Name_; **Implemented by** the component with _Go to Source_ and **Replace with** (another component with a compatible promise); **Timing** — one system domain per timing parameter; **Ports** — each port's state: _Bound to …_ with _Show Binding_, _Open: nothing supplies it yet. Draw a link from a provided port or a top-level …_, or a parameter's **Value** (a closed constant); **Findings**; _Delete …_ (_Disconnect its ports first; the component stays._)."
